SPARTA (24 Sep 2025)
Running on 4 MPI task(s)
################################################################################
# tabulated reaction cross sections in a 3d box
#
# react table reacts a selected collision with probability
# sigma_react(E)/sigma_total(E), so an ab initio or measured reactive cross
# section can be used directly, with no Arrhenius fit
#
# Note:
#  - The "comm/sort” option to the “global” command is used to match MPI runs.
#  - The “twopass” option is used to match Kokkos runs.
# The "comm/sort" and "twopass" options should not be used for production runs.
################################################################################

seed	    	    12345
dimension   	    3
global              gridcut 1.0e-5 comm/sort yes

boundary	    rr rr rr

create_box  	    0 0.0001 0 0.0001 0 0.0001
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (0.0001 0.0001 0.0001)
create_grid 	    10 10 10
WARNING: Could not acquire nearby ghost cells b/c grid partition is not clumped (../grid.cpp:473)
Created 1000 child grid cells
  CPU time = 0.00110156 secs
  create/ghost percent = 89.0549 10.9451

balance_grid        rcb part
Balance grid migrated 740 cells
  CPU time = 0.000897552 secs
  reassign/sort/migrate/ghost percent = 52.9408 0.265054 16.8135 29.9807

species		    react.species X Y
mixture		    air X Y vstream 0.0 0.0 0.0 temp 8000.0
mixture             air X frac 1.0
mixture             air Y frac 0.0

global              nrho 7.07043E22
global              fnum 7.07043E5

collide		    vss air react.vss
react               table react.reactions

create_particles    air n 10000 twopass
Created 10000 particles
  CPU time = 0.00137232 secs

stats		    500
compute             temp temp
stats_style	    step cpu np nattempt ncoll nreact c_temp

timestep 	    7.00E-9
run 		    5000
